Signal-trigger / signal-condition value_num thresholds: per locked-policy
precedent from Phase-43/0024 (telemetry generic raw-signal viewers), the unit
semantics live in the user-selected signal NAME not in page-level rendering;
applying convertDistanceFromSI to a raw battery_level threshold or inside_temp
threshold would distort the comparison the user wrote. The user-typed threshold
is interpreted in the same canonical SI unit signal_log stores post-Phase-42,
so no boundary conversion is correct.

