=== PAGE_PORT ===
All 10 pages: NO CHANGES required. Same outcome as Phase-43/0024 (telemetry).

Per-page rationale:
  ActionBuilder.tsx               -- vehicle-command picker, JSON params editor,
                                     notification template, setting key/value;
                                     no SI quantities, snake_case throughout.
  AutomationActivityFeed.tsx      -- history rows render automation_name,
                                     status, triggered_at (timeAgo), duration_ms
                                     (formatDurationMs), actions_succeeded /
                                     actions_total ratios, success_rate %; all
                                     snake_case, all backed by
                                     models.AutomationHistory at
                                     internal/models/models.go:487-507. No SI
                                     quantities; ms is already a wire-canonical
                                     unit handled by formatDurationMs.
  AutomationBuilderPage.tsx       -- form uses snake_case (vehicle_id, enabled,
                                     triggers, conditions, actions, cron_expr,
                                     timezone, place_id, dwell_minutes, signal,
                                     op, value_num, value_text, value_bool,
                                     value_min, value_max, days_of_week,
                                     start_time, end_time, command_name,
                                     command_params, channel_id, template,
                                     setting_key, target_automation_id,
                                     other_automation_id); validates against
                                     payload sent through useCreate/UpdateAutomationFull.
                                     No display-time SI conversion required.
  AutomationCard.tsx              -- renders a.name, a.description,
                                     a.auto_disabled, a.enabled, a.execution_count,
                                     a.failure_count, a.last_triggered_at,
                                     a.next_fire_time, a.auto_disabled_reason,
                                     a.conflicts; all snake_case. Type assert
                                     extras live in api/types.ts Automation type
                                     extension; backend currently emits only the
                                     models.Automation root + next_fire_time +
                                     conflicts (see automation_handler_dtos.go
                                     line 14-18) so the runtime extras
                                     (execution_count, failure_count, etc.) are
                                     undefined-tolerant via existing null checks
                                     -- pre-existing locked-policy concern out of
                                     scope here.
  AutomationListPage.tsx          -- bulk-manage table; reads a.name,
                                     a.description, a.execution_count, a.enabled
                                     -- snake_case. Same locked-policy concern
                                     as AutomationCard.tsx for execution_count.
  AutomationsListPage.tsx         -- main hub; reads a.name, a.description,
                                     a.enabled, a.auto_disabled, a.vehicle_id;
                                     snake_case throughout. computeStats reads
                                     a.auto_disabled and a.enabled. SSE event
                                     handler reads automation_id / name / mode.
                                     historyResponse?.items / .summary match
                                     AutomationHistoryListResponse.
  ConditionBuilder.tsx            -- typed condition forms (signal/time-window/
                                     geofence/other-automation); snake_case;
                                     value_num, value_min, value_max, place_id,
                                     start_time, end_time, days_of_week,
                                     other_automation_id, state -- all match
                                     wire shape.
  ConflictWarnings.tsx            -- consumes AutomationConflict[]
                                     (automation_id, automation_name, reason,
                                     severity); snake_case match.
  PresetGallery.tsx               -- consumes AutomationPreset.id/name/category/
                                     description/icon/triggers[]/actions[];
                                     snake_case match.
  TriggerConfigurator.tsx         -- typed trigger forms (schedule/event/
                                     geofence/signal); cron_expr, timezone,
                                     event_type, place_id, dwell_minutes,
                                     signal, op, value_num/text/bool -- all
                                     snake_case match.

